{"id":"7bfce7cbe8","t":"Surviving as a Genius on Borrowed Time","c":"cv","n":100,"l":99,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time"},"u":1795038688419,"desc":"[من الاستوديو الذي قدم لكم {عودة الشيطان المجنون}! و{التراجع المطلق}! وُلِد جونغ يون-شين مقدر له عمر قصير، ولا يمكنه لعيش بعد سن العشرين. رغم أن الجميع في عائلته كانوا ينظرون إليه بازدراء، إلا أن مهاراته كانت رائعة بما يكفي لابتكار فنونه القتالية الخاصة. في أحد الأيام، أدرك يون-شين أنه لم يتبقَ له الكثير من الوقت للعيش… وهنا يبدأ جونغ يون-شين، العبقري المحتضر، كفاحه اليائس من أجل البقاء!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","فنون قتاليه","مغامرة","موريم"],"src":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/1/"},"2":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/2/"},"3":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/3/"},"4":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/4/"},"5":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/5/"},"6":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/6/"},"7":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/7/"},"8":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/8/"},"9":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/9/"},"10":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/10/"},"11":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/11/"},"12":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time/12/"},"13":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-genius-on-borrowed-time|/manga/surviving-a